For making more fun in the game we prepared some hot fixes:
- Arena "Library" is now avaliable for 1x1 and 2x2 matches;
- MOBA arena "Abandoned Square" now avaliable from 3x3 up to 5x5;
- Fixed possible stuns after respawns during duel arena "Death Theater";
- Time in Briefing window increased from 60 secconds up to 3 minutes;
- Some other bug fixes.

